# INVWINID.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the notes of the
# item screens at level 3, on the status bar's help panel.  DEL on item
# 3, answered Y, says "Item 3 deleted"; INS with a category, "Item 4
# added"; in a search's results item 1, its model changed after CTRL+E,
# "Item 1 saved"; in item 1's parts item 2, installed and its model
# changed after CTRL+E, "Item 2 saved", which a click on the status bar
# ends, as a key does; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINID.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K DOWN DOWN DEL Y
S DELETED
K INS
T SYS
K ENTER
S ADDED
# the search's results: the model by its letter
K ALT-S T
T IBM
K ENTER ENTER CTRL-E ALT-D
T 5160
K ENTER
S FOUND
# the item list again, then item 1's parts
K ESC ESC HOME ALT-C P INS
T 2
K ENTER ENTER CTRL-E ALT-D
T TM100-6
K ENTER
S PART
M 201 DOWN MID
M 201 UP MID
S CLICKED
K ALT-F X
